/* --- 키보드: 0–4 챕터 이동 · R = 화면 중앙에 가장 가까운 DOGMA 저항 --- */
addEventListener('keydown',function(e){
  if(!entered || e.metaKey || e.ctrlKey || e.altKey || /INPUT|TEXTAREA/.test(e.target.tagName)) return;
  if(/^[0-4]$/.test(e.key)){ var t=sections[+e.key]; if(t) t.scrollIntoView({behavior:reduce?'auto':'smooth'}); }
  if(e.key==='r'||e.key==='R'){ var best=null, bd=1e9;
    $$('.dogma').forEach(function(d){ var r=d.getBoundingClientRect(), dd=Math.abs(r.top+r.height/2-innerHeight/2); if(dd<bd){bd=dd;best=d;} });
    if(best && bd<innerHeight*.5) $('.resist-btn',best).click(); }
});

/* --- v3 루프 --- */
(function v3(now){ drawTape(); drawScan(now); drawNeedle(); if(scrollY<innerHeight*1.2) drawHeroScale(); requestAnimationFrame(v3); })(performance.now());
